    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρχ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the government of an</i>
